生まれのわりに日本語はぺらぺら。妖艶な一面を見せたかと思えば子供っぽい一面も垣間見えたりと、とらえどころのない印象がある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204078"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27035","sourceWorkId":"7009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/360a85034b1d53cd87e15164dd7ddea1daeb103364cd34074c0632cf585e39c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/5040e1ab8208d74734e32b03f33acf29168d49d68bb9adeb6f767cc63a05687f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"ももぞの薫","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267725:204078:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c52178","characterName":"瀬良 すみれ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"204079","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"267725"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27032"],"vndbCharacterId":"c52178"},"originalCharacterName":"瀬良 すみれ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a student in the class that the protagonist is in charge of. She is tries to appeal to him by shortening her skirt, but he doesn't notice. She has feelings for him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In reality, she is a family-oriented, caring, and caring person. Because of her slightly childish face, she often wants to be taller than necessary and hates being treated like a child."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52178"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立カリギュラ女学園に通う女子学生。Eカップ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の担当するクラスの学生。他の女子たちと違い、主人公に好意的な態度で接してくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"心優しく、家庭的で面倒見の良い性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや童顔で子供っぽく、それを気にして、必要以上に背伸びしたがる。そのため、子供扱いされると不機嫌になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に想いを寄せている彼女は、スカートの丈を短くするなどしてアピールしているが、なかなか気付いて貰えない。処女らしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27032","sourceWorkId":"7009","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪太郎が担当するクラスの生徒。スカートの丈を短くしたりして悪太郎にアピールしてるが、悪太郎に想いは届かず。実際は家庭的で世話好きと、面倒見のいい性格をしている。やや童顔のため、必要以上に背伸びしたがる事が多く、子ども扱いされる事を嫌う。悪太郎に思いを寄せているが、なかなか相手は気付かない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204079"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27032","sourceWorkId":"7009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f801e3ada4e9921b2ee9f0f309054faf8b51f20d73a0525a4839a0d0efbd370.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/752d556baf970a83b8a89a894f9936d708cd34601c3986d90b502690d59c7f1d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中田順子","creatorId":"vndb:s631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s631","name":"中田 順子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267725:204079:4463:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c52179","characterName":"淡路 麗子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"204080","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"267725"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27034"],"vndbCharacterId":"c52179"},"originalCharacterName":"淡路 麗子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a student in the protagonist's class, but unlike Sumire, she is in a position to torment him. Although she has the title of leader of the “student council,” in reality, she controls and encourages students to engage in compensated dating for the purpose of getting a cut of the profits."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The number of teachers who have been kicked out of school for doing anything that displeases her has already reached double digits. She is a picture-perfect young lady and has been selfish all her life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her hobby is swimming, but she likes feeling the eyes of those who are glued to her body more than swimming itself. She is a girl who is thrilled about the protagonist's good looks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52179"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立カリギュラ女学園に通う女子学生。Fカップ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の担当するクラスの学生で、リーダー的な存在。すみれとは異なり、主人公を虐める側。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"絵に描いたようなお嬢様で、これまでワガママ放題に育ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒の援助交際を統括・手引きして中間マージンを得ている学園公認の売春組織という裏の顔を持つ「学友会」のリーダー格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の機嫌を損ねて学園を追い出された教師は二桁に達するとの噂も……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"線が細く、美少年系の主人公にゾクゾクきているらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27034","sourceWorkId":"7009","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の担当するクラスの生徒だが、すみれとは異なり主人公を虐める立場。一応「学友会（生徒会）」のリーダーという肩書きを持ってはいるが、その実態は生徒の援助交際を統括・手引きして中間マージンを得るというとんでもないもの。彼女の気に障る真似をして学校を追い出された教師は既に二桁に達する。絵に描いたようなお嬢様であり、我儘放題で今までやってきた。趣味は水泳だが、泳ぐ事そのものよりも、自分の肉体に釘付けになっている者たちの視線を感じる事が好き。線が細くて、美少年系の主人公にゾクゾクきている女の子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204080"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27034","sourceWorkId":"7009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe443b1c681b297d0cb2b1f4231ad5f3f72c13d41135700ae636312bb41935f7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/249dd7afd15a70a95f59403101087a1a77bb67348e9a1d37354e60426ba7c680.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267725:204080:4956:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c52180","characterName":"志賀 香澄","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"204081","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"267725"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27036"],"vndbCharacterId":"c52180"},"originalCharacterName":"志賀 香澄","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A student in the protagonist's class. She is good friends with Sumire and is often seen with her. She is also fond of the protagonist and talks to him about a lot of things."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She used to work at a brothel mediated by the student association in order to earn money. The protagonist admonished her and she responded with, \"well, will you be my partner?\" and a sexual relationship began between the two."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she herself is quite open about her sexual activities, so the relationship doesn't become a messy affair. She is a gossipy person and is in control of more than 90% of the rumors in the school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52180"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立カリギュラ女学園に通う女子学生。Eカップ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の担当するクラスの学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すみれと仲が良いらしく、いつも一緒にいるところを見かける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すみれと同じく主人公に好意的で、あれこれ話しかけてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「学友会」が斡旋している風俗店で小遣い稼ぎをしていたが、主人公に諭されて「じゃあセンセイが相手してくれる～？」などと誘惑し、主人公と肉体関係を持ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性に関してオープンな彼女は、主人公との関係をまったく重く感じていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなりの噂好きらしく、学園内に飛び交う噂の大部分を掌握しているという。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27036","sourceWorkId":"7009","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の担当するクラスの生徒。すみれと仲が良く、良く一緒に居るところを見かける。また主人公に対しても好意的で、あれこれと話しかけてくる。元々風俗店（本番なしのヘルス。もちろん学友会が斡旋している）で小遣いを稼いでいたが、主人公に諭されて「じゃあセンセイが相手してくれる～？」などとなしくずしのうちに肉体関係を持ってしまった。だが彼女自身、性行為に関してはかなりオープンなので、ドロドロとした関係にはならない。かなりの噂好きで、学校内の噂を9割以上掌握している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204081"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27036","sourceWorkId":"7009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/03983705be81fc6b204a2fa6db33881f14a53d85fd4ec2bf72df00c3d4136911.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e0c1fe503418250f08f06cff34223c4940555b221325a452d35dbba56c8645ee.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梶田夕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267725:204081:6106:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c52181","characterName":"日振 しのぶ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"204082","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"267725"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27033"],"vndbCharacterId":"c52181"},"originalCharacterName":"日振 しのぶ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the 2nd in command of the student association, and is vying for Reiko's position. She is the head of the tennis club and is a national-level player."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She may look like a neat and quiet liberal arts girl, but when it comes to sex, she is quite voracious. However, since no man has ever been able to satisfy her, she secretly believes that “all men are trash\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is notable for her large breasts, which have helped her rise to her current position. She also lactates due to her body's constitution."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52181"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立カリギュラ女学園に通う女子学生。Gカップ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚な外見から、大人しい文系少女の印象を与えるが、非常に活発。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テニス部の部長を務め、その腕前は全国レベル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園公認売春組織という裏の顔を持つ「学友会」のナンバー2の座にあり、そのリーダー格である淡路麗子と覇権を争っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性に関しては貪欲さを持ち、未だかつて彼女を満足させられた男子がいないことから、内心では「男なんてチョロイ」と思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魅力的なバストは、体質ゆえか母乳も出る。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27033","sourceWorkId":"7009","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「学友会」のナンバー2であり、麗子と学友会の覇権を争う、もう片方の首魁でもある。テニス部部長であり、全国レベルの腕前を持つ。外見は清楚で大人しい文系少女といった感じだが、性に関してはかなりの貪欲さを持つ。だがいまだかつて彼女を満足させられた男がいないため、内心では「男なんてチョロい」と思っている。特筆すべきはその巨乳で、現在の地位まで上り詰めたのもそのおかげ。体質ゆえか母乳も出る。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204082"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27033","sourceWorkId":"7009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f3fd61d172c1187d9b30560f51de006bd31dc8281fa32c1871d2edaea102a6a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70e66e6462a18ba1470825f0e54fddccc60b993b7a88ca3d024c0c78897f27ec.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永田佳代","creatorId":"vndb:s266","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s266","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s266","name":"永田 佳代","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267725:204082:6038:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c52182","characterName":"粟國 ケイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"204083","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"267725"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27037"],"vndbCharacterId":"c52182"},"originalCharacterName":"粟國 ケイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is not under the charge of the protagonist. She is often mentioned in staff meetings as a problem child who does not go to school very often."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist happened to see her downtown being relentlessly hit on, and helped her. Since then, he has repeatedly tried persuading her to go to school to no avail."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she seems to have begun to take an interest in the protagonist. She is also open about her sexuality, and often seduces him by saying things like, “If you do naughty things with me, I'll go to school~\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52182"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立カリギュラ女学園に通う女子学生。Fカップ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不登校学生で、問題児として職員会議で名前が挙がることもしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"繁華街で執拗にナンパされているところを主人公に助けられたことがあり、それが縁となって、主人公からあれこれ説得されるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不登校は直っていないが、主人公に興味を持ち始めているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性に関してはかなりオープンで主人公に「エッチしてくれたら学校に行ってもいいかな」などと誘惑してくることも……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27037","sourceWorkId":"7009","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の担当ではないが、あまり学校に来ない問題児として職員会議でしばしば名前が挙がる。主人公は偶然繁華街で執拗にナンパされているところを助け、それ以来あれこれと説得を繰り返して学校に来るよう諭しているが、今のところ効果はない。ただ主人公に対しては興味を持ち始めているようだ。性に関してもオープンで、「Hしてくれたら学校行ってもいいかな～」などと誘惑してくる事もしばしば。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204083"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27037","sourceWorkId":"7009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8cfc0e86accab62e2f462e54dc639c284041091a8a4754b0debb3e8082233e19.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/8951b75744dc9f2897e2b3ee02e54187898e9182984e4a32b0de5d7297ca48ee.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梶田夕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267725:204083:6106:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c52183","characterName":"対馬 綾乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"204084","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"267725"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27040"],"vndbCharacterId":"c52183"},"originalCharacterName":"対馬 綾乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A colleague of the protagonist, she is a female teacher assigned by the school principal to supervise him as a newcomer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was originally chosen because of her caring nature, but since she is more of a nag than a caretaker, it is charming to see her re-tightening his tie as if she were his new wife."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is of half German descent but goes by a Japanese name. At first glance, she seems to have nothing to do with sexual activities, but in fact, she is quite lewd and has masochistic tendencies. She is fond of the protagonist and pretends to be his big sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52183"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立カリギュラ女学園に勤める女教師で、主人公の先輩（＝同僚）。Hカップ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドイツ系のハーフだが、和名を名乗っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園長から主人公の指導を命じられ、元々、世話好きなこともあって、ネクタイを締め直してあげたり、毎日お弁当を作って持ってきてあげたりと新妻のように甲斐甲斐しく世話をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見すれば清楚なお姉さん風の彼女だが、実はかなりの淫乱気質でマゾ的な属性が強い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27040","sourceWorkId":"7009","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の同僚で、新米の彼を指導するよう校長からいいつけられた女教師。元々世話好きな所があったため指名されたのだが、世話好きというよりも小うるさいため、まるで新妻のようにネクタイを締めなおしてあげている姿はほほえましい。ドイツ系のハーフだが、日本名を名乗っている。一見性的な行為とは無縁と思いきや、実はかなりの淫乱気質でマゾ属性がある。主人公のことを気に入っていて、お姉さん風をふかしてくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204084"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"h","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27040","sourceWorkId":"7009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/7814b8a7c8bbe3cd865ac067dd2fef5fea7c0b2683a087be99d4f9339b8456b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4a813058f17dd479aa9ce0d9836f45efc13d0aa49945d27332a6889dfa9b44f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西沢広香","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"榊木春乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267725:204084:5890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c52184","characterName":"若宮 由里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"204085","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"267725"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27039"],"vndbCharacterId":"c52184"},"originalCharacterName":"若宮 由里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Headmistress of Tengoku Jogakuen. The original founder was her father. She has a politician husband, and she herself has connections with the media and lawmakers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is the true head of the association, she seldom opens herself to the members of the Diet. Despite her demure face and her coercive manner which is similar to Reiko, she is masochist, a secret that even her husband does not know."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She comes from a well-known family. She married her husband because their interests matched, not out of love."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52184"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立カリギュラ女学園の学園長。Hカップ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"政治家の夫を持ち、そういった方面のコネクションを持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親が学園の創立者で、家柄はかなりの名家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚した夫とは、あくまでも利害関係が一致したに過ぎず、愛情はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高圧的な物言いをするが、実は重度のマゾヒスト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"売春組織という裏の顔を持つ「学友会」の実質的な元締めだが、自身が体を提供することは滅多にない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27039","sourceWorkId":"7009","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天獄女学園の学園長。元々の創立者は彼女の父親。政治家の夫を持ち、彼女自身もマスコミや議員たちにあれこれとコネクションを持っている。「学友会」の実質的な元締めだが、自身が議員たちに身体を開く事は滅多にない。つんと澄ました顔と麗子を髣髴とさせる高圧的な物言いとは裏腹に重度のマゾヒストで、これは夫も知らない彼女だけの秘密だった。それなり以上の名家の出身。夫と結婚したのは利害関係が一致したからであって、愛情はない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204085"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"h","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27039","sourceWorkId":"7009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a952eba71f0cda12f1319a95fa9a1a2f05a67796603e7406e7e05a8442fa920.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68424de7dffda5a46c4867d40ad4080ebe4f7771441117ca697bf380146f01dd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"ももぞの薫","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267725:204085:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c52185","characterName":"伊唐 涼子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"204086","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"267725"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27038"],"vndbCharacterId":"c52185"},"originalCharacterName":"伊唐 涼子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Newscaster for a well-known TV station. Recently, she married a young actor and caused a sensation all over the news."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In reality, there is no affection between them, as both parties have their own agendas to gain popularity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is involved behind the scenes with the principal of the school who is also powerful authority in the world of politics, and ensures that no damaging information gets leaked to the media."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She plans to rise to a higher position and she will not hesitate to use her own body as a weapon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52185"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"某有名テレビ局のニュースキャスター。Gカップ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近、若手俳優と結婚してワイドショーを賑わせたが、実は人気取りを狙った思惑があり、双方に愛情はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女は、裏で私立カリギュラ女学園の学園長の若宮由里や、政界の重鎮などとの関係を持ち、まずい情報を流さないように工作している。後々は、そうしたコネクションを使ってのし上がろうと画策しており、そのためなら自分の体を使うことも厭わない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27038","sourceWorkId":"7009","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"某有名TV局のニュースキャスター。最近若手俳優と結婚してワイドショーを騒がせた。実際には人気取りを狙った双方の思惑があり、愛情はない。だが実は裏で校長や政界の重鎮などと関わりを持ち、まずい情報を流さないよう工作している。そして後々はもっと上にまでのし上がろうと画策している。そのためには自らの肉体を武器とすることも躊躇わない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204086"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27038","sourceWorkId":"7009","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5ee9bc3b70ef5cba3947b90bc517f9385771368ac40d8b2641707dde56d2352a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3eacc182728d0f27e4b8fdf4b43f38b67f3340377430601a3968824bd0bbf1f5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西沢広香","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"榊木春乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267725:204086:5890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c52176","characterName":"黒羽 悪太郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c52176"},"originalCharacterName":"黒羽 悪太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A recently hired mathematics teacher. Mild mannered and good looking, he is the opposite of what his name represents. Because of this, he has always been bullied easily."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52176"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44d3938ae01a64f030fbaf0ef0ce8b55d5b165261df5e7b3a8ac67e37edc6c9d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7ec4e07bf126c3636167363325987fb1714003bef8b49eea9381b25bebb64b3c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c52186","characterName":"魚釣 廉十郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c52186"},"originalCharacterName":"魚釣 廉十郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b8449da3cb9b5bcd20fa41b41d9cce7cda6b62a61823d6aca7f33451d4fd1273.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b7aa374fca9be3047f2e2fb3b073b235607fc8cd8b7e9fb7339bd2a1c7299745.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c52187","characterName":"瓜楢 毒人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c52187"},"originalCharacterName":"瓜楢 毒人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/647aeb973f795377b67bc59719bd177550c4be886612b777017b64b096805c14.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/termi